## Assurance

```yaml
ASSURANCE_STATUS:
  schema_version: "1.1"   # post-cutoff (2026-07-28_1400); v1.0 still accepted for legacy runs
  subject: "<livraison ou décision certifiée>"
  implementation_status: "<NOT_STARTED|IN_PROGRESS|IMPLEMENTED|ABANDONED>"
  conformity_status: "<NOT_ASSESSED|PASS_CONFORMITY|FAIL_CONFORMITY|NOT_APPLICABLE>"
  adversarial_status: "<NOT_ASSESSED|NOT_REQUIRED|IN_CAMPAIGN|FINDINGS_OPEN|PASS_ADVERSARIAL|FAIL_ADVERSARIAL>"
  certification_status: "<NOT_CERTIFIED|CERTIFIED|SUSPENDED|NOT_APPLICABLE|UNASSESSED_LEGACY|PRE_CERTIFICATION|MIGRATION>"
  # PRE_CERTIFICATION companion fields (required when certification_status=PRE_CERTIFICATION)
  transient_reason: "<required when PRE_CERTIFICATION or MIGRATION>"
  bootstrapped_at: "<ISO8601 UTC; required when PRE_CERTIFICATION>"
  bootstrapped_by: "<identifier; required when PRE_CERTIFICATION>"
  # MIGRATION companion fields (required when certification_status=MIGRATION)
  migrating_from: "<version; required when MIGRATION>"
  migrating_to: "<version; required when MIGRATION>"
  migration_started_at: "<ISO8601 UTC; required when MIGRATION>"
  migration_plan_ref: "<run_id; required when MIGRATION>"
  migration_completion_deadline: "<ISO8601 UTC; required when MIGRATION>"
  gate_results:
    - gate_id: "<stable-id>"
      gate_family: "<DESIGN|CERTIFICATION|ADVERSARIAL|OTHER>"
      checkpoint: "<PRE_IMPLEMENTATION|POST_IMPLEMENTATION|COUNTER_PROOF|CLOSEOUT>"
      subject: "<sujet borné>"
      verdict: "<PASS|FAIL|NOT_ASSESSED|NOT_APPLICABLE>"
      evidence: ["<preuve>"]
      reasons: ["<raison factuelle>"]
      applicability:
        profile_id: "<requis uniquement pour NOT_APPLICABLE>"
        status: "NOT_APPLICABLE"
        evidence: ["<déclaration de profil>"]
  implementation_authorization:
    status: "<AUTHORIZED|NOT_AUTHORIZED>"
    required_gate_ids: ["<gate-id>"]
    reasons: ["<raison explicite>"]
```

Ce bloc est frère de `FINAL_STATUS`; aucune inférence croisée. Un
`CERTIFICATION: FAIL` pré-implémentation impose `HANDOFF` et
`NOT_AUTHORIZED`. Un échec post-implémentation impose `HANDOFF` et livraison
non certifiée. Le Design PASS reste acquis sauf reclassification substantive.

